00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.367
-It is time for "Tonight Show"
hashtags. Here we go.

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:04.834
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:09.300
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.567
-Now, we do this thing every
week where I send out a hashtag

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:17.667
and I ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:20.000
So since Christmas
is next Saturday --

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.567
Gosh, that's happening fast.

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:26.200
I sent out the
#AddAWordRuinAChristmasSong.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.501
I asked you guys to just share

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:29.234
your funniest ruined
Christmas songs.

00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:31.000
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.667
so thank you for playing along
on Twitter.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.234
Now I thought I'd share

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:38.667
