from you guys.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:42.133
This first one is
from @depthsofwinters.

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.901
He says, "Jolly Old
St. Nicolas Cage."

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.334
