00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:05.934
Ah, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:08.267
Does anyone work here?!

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.567
Anyone work here?
Okay, I'll check myself out.

00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:12.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:14.667
